- 스킬: {% if skill_topic %}{{ skill_topic }}{% else %}{{ category }}{% endif %}
- 인원: {{ participants_expected_count }}명
- venue: {% if venue_type %}{{ venue_type }}{% else %}cafe{% endif %}

{% if price_breakdown %}
## 결정된 가격 (변경 금지)
- base_fee: **{{ price_breakdown.base_fee }}원**
- included_items (포함 항목):
{% for item in price_breakdown.included_items %}  · **{{ item.name }}**: {{ item.value }}
{% endfor %}
{% if price_breakdown.optional_addons and price_breakdown.optional_addons|length > 0 %}
